#: temp.glade:20834 temp.glade:20835
msgid "Additional Script Settings..."
msgstr "अतिरिक्त स्क्रिप्ट सेटिंग्स…"

#: temp.glade:20840
msgid "A small number of complex scripts (such as\n"
"Myanmar, Indic, Arabic & Han) have additional\n"
"options which can be set individually."
